flowchart LR
    classDef client fill:#e4ecf5,stroke:#5e563d,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#20201d
    classDef web fill:#edebe7,stroke:#5e563d,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#20201d
    classDef api fill:#f0efeb,stroke:#5e563d,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#20201d
    classDef db fill:#f4f3f1,stroke:#5e563d,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#20201d
    classDef ext fill:#f7f7f6,stroke:#8b7638,stroke-width:1.2px,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#20201d

    USER[Users<br/>Donors / Requesters<br/>Admins]:::client
    WEB[Next.js App Router<br/>Vercel<br/>SSR + Client]:::web
    API[NestJS REST API<br/>Render<br/>/api/v1/*]:::api
    AUTH[Supabase Auth<br/>OTP / Email]:::db
    POOL[Connection Pooler<br/>Supavisor]:::db
    DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>RLS Enabled)]:::db
    EMAIL[Email Service<br/>Resend]:::ext
    SMS[SMS Provider<br/>Future Phase]:::ext

    USER -->|HTTPS| WEB
    WEB -->|REST + JWT| API
    WEB -.Server-side calls.-> AUTH
    API -->|Verify JWT| AUTH
    API -->|Prisma Client| POOL
    POOL --> DB
    API -->|Transactional| EMAIL
    API -.later.-> SMS
